      <title>N.J. man sentenced to decades in prison for fatal shooting at Bucks County strip club</title>
      <link>https://www.phillyvoice.com/bucks-county-strip-club-shooting-sentencing/?utm_source=pv-rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=pv-site</link>
      <description>A Trenton man has been sentenced to 30 to 60 years in prison for fatally shooting a bystander at the Border Gentleman's Club in Morrisville, Bucks County on Aug. 29, 2024. Mekhi Norman, 28, was struck multiple times when he attempted to intervene in a fight on behalf of the club's staff.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.phillyvoice.com/bucks-county-strip-club-shooting-sentencing/?utm_source=pv-rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=pv-site</guid>
